{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08345","headline":"赠僧朝美 · 李白","name":"赠僧朝美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水客凌洪波，长鲸涌溟海。\n百川随龙舟，嘘吸竟安在。\n中有不死者，探得明月珠。\n高价倾宇宙，余辉照江湖。\n苞卷金缕褐，萧然若空无。\n谁人识此宝，窃笑有狂夫。\n了心何言说，各勉黄金躯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}